A||||9||sjp777||Brake pedal fell off!||||1||
Z||000000||sjp777||06-09-2001||11:26 AM||||So I'm driving home from work the other day and notice my brake pedal feels a little wierd. I look down and the pedal is laying on the floor and I'd been braking with my foot only on the shaft hanging down.<P>Upon further inspection at home, I find nothing really broke, but that the pedal is not even welded to the shaft. It is just pressed on to a square post that sticks out from the front of the shaft.<P>WTF??!!! Pressed on? Friggin cheapass GM. Isn't there some kind of saftey issue with that? This is the brake pedal after all.<P>I'll be spending the afternoon trying to come up with a better bonding method than pressed on.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg"> <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||fropuff||06-09-2001||12:14 PM||||Holy $hit; that could've been pretty bad!  Have you ever used JB-Weld?  It works pretty good.||||reg||1
Z||000002||cadaver||06-09-2001||01:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fropuff:<BR><B>Holy $hit; that could've been pretty bad!  Have you ever used JB-Weld?  It works pretty good.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>JB WELD? NO NO NO just get it welded. If you go to some one good they wont burn you carpet. But you could always take it out. Its not to bad to remove.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||isthiswhereiputausername?||06-09-2001||06:32 PM||||I always thought there was a little wire clip holding them on?<P>check behind it and see if theres a hold you can put a clip/wire/nail though to hold it.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||06-09-2001||08:46 PM||||There's a couple clips to take off. nothing major. I'd take it out just to make it easier to work on for welding. <P>You may as well put a new rubber pad on. you can find them in the red Help! packages from MotorMite. They are only a couple dollars.||||reg||1
